{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261018/photo/bkn-20261018182617611-1018_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261018212852\"/><p>事主被送往廣華醫院搶救，可惜未能保住性命。</p><p>今晨(18日)9時35分，油麻地廣東道566號一單位內，一名51歲尼泊爾籍男住戶懷疑暈倒，由朋友協助報助。事主昏迷不醒，由救護車送往廣華醫院治理後，最終惜告不治。據悉，事主生前有身體病紀錄，其死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T13:38:44.877327+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T10:26:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T13:57:54.943551+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T13:37:44.435002+00:00","content_hash":"81117f5e816d4d21a7d233b4d485ed89193783923d336605247fe66d184a6563","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}